WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.017 --> 00:00:18.703
A few minutes earlier, Zann and Perda had been chasing Zing through First City.

2
00:00:19.543 --> 00:00:22.784
The dragon was flying along the street, staying just out of reach.

3
00:00:23.665 --> 00:00:27.106
Every few seconds, he stopped to shoot flames back in their direction.

4
00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:30.408
"Calm down, Zing," Zann called.

5
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.242
"My parents are the ones who said you can't come to Mount Mystery with us.

6
00:00:35.223 --> 00:00:37.304
It wasn't my idea to leave you at the zoo!"

7
00:00:38.044 --> 00:00:41.026
Zing sent another angry fireball toward Zann's head.

8
00:00:41.046 --> 00:00:43.107
"Cut it out!"

9
00:00:43.568 --> 00:00:44.768
Zann shouted, ducking.

10
00:00:45.629 --> 00:00:47.330
Perda whistled.

11
00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:48.991
"Come on, Zing.

12
00:00:49.531 --> 00:00:51.993
You usually like staying with Mima."

13
00:00:52.913 --> 00:00:56.816
Mima was a Void animal caretaker and a friend of Zann's family.

14
00:00:58.076 --> 00:01:01.698
Zann knew she would take great care of Zing while Zann was away.

15
00:01:02.679 --> 00:01:05.260
Zing perked up for a second at the mention of her name.

16
00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:08.822
But then he shot more fire and flew off again.

17
00:01:08.842 --> 00:01:11.864
"Argh!" Zann groaned.

18
00:01:12.724 --> 00:01:15.105
Perda laughed.

19
00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:16.986
"Come on.

20
00:01:17.026 --> 00:01:19.167
He'll get bored with this game eventually."

21
00:01:20.028 --> 00:01:23.890
The kids chased Zing through a park and past a couple of restaurants.

22
00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:27.192
Finally the little dragon disappeared around a corner.

23
00:01:28.104 --> 00:01:29.865
Zann paused to catch his breath.

24
00:01:29.885 --> 00:01:32.445
"We should stop and send a message to Zella.

25
00:01:33.266 --> 00:01:37.187
Boz contacted the mayor of Stone Wall to let her know we're coming to check out that cave.

26
00:01:38.027 --> 00:01:39.947
But I want to let Zella and her friends know too.

27
00:01:40.748 --> 00:01:44.309
After all, they're the ones who discovered the cave and spotted the possible relic."

28
00:01:45.589 --> 00:01:47.630
"We don't have to stop," Perda said.

29
00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:49.630
"I'll summon a spy fly.

30
00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.771
We can record a video message while we're chasing your goofy dragon."

31
00:01:53.791 --> 00:01:55.912
"Good plan," Zann said.

32
00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:57.841
Perda snapped her fingers.

33
00:01:58.762 --> 00:02:01.524
Seconds later a spy fly buzzed over to them.

34
00:02:02.344 --> 00:02:05.347
Perda created friction and then touched the spy fly.

35
00:02:05.367 --> 00:02:06.748
"Video blink!"

36
00:02:07.148 --> 00:02:07.528
she said.

37
00:02:07.548 --> 00:02:10.190
"Okay, Zann, we can start recording."

38
00:02:11.471 --> 00:02:13.853
Zann cleared his throat and looked at the fly.

39
00:02:13.873 --> 00:02:15.214
"Hi, Zella.

40
00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:18.456
Perda and I are in First City, and we wanted to tell you something."

41
00:02:19.077 --> 00:02:19.737
Perda waved.

42
00:02:19.757 --> 00:02:21.038
"Hey, Zella.

43
00:02:21.499 --> 00:02:23.120
The cave you found sounds cool."

44
00:02:24.156 --> 00:02:27.357
Zann spotted Zing peering back around the corner at them.

45
00:02:28.177 --> 00:02:30.998
He headed after the little dragon, talking while he walked.

46
00:02:32.058 --> 00:02:35.099
Perda stayed by his side, and the fly hovered in front of them.

47
00:02:35.119 --> 00:02:39.280
"We told my parents about the staff that disappeared," Zann said.

48
00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:44.301
"They're concerned, especially because it might have belonged to old King Zanta.

49
00:02:45.462 --> 00:02:50.863
And because something terrible happened—the Mask of Zanta just disappeared from the palace."

50
00:02:51.683 --> 00:02:54.601
"Nobody can figure out how it disappeared," Perda said.

51
00:02:54.621 --> 00:02:58.644
"Everyone who entered the safe room was authorized to be there.

52
00:02:59.725 --> 00:03:02.187
And there are protective barriers inside the palace.

53
00:03:02.947 --> 00:03:07.831
Nobody can zap in there, or use a Masking spell or an Invisibility spell or anything like that."

54
00:03:08.932 --> 00:03:11.674
"My mom thinks a Festian might have taken it."

55
00:03:12.095 --> 00:03:14.677
Zann thought back over what his parents had said.

56
00:03:14.697 --> 00:03:19.160
"She and Dad visited Fest once during their travels through the vortex.

57
00:03:20.061 --> 00:03:23.124
They said it's an odd world with fairly weak magic."

58
00:03:24.072 --> 00:03:25.954
A short distance ahead lay the river.

59
00:03:26.754 --> 00:03:30.177
Zing was sitting on the bank, keeping an eye on them as they approached.

60
00:03:30.998 --> 00:03:34.001
Zann lunged forward, trying to grab the dragon's wing.

61
00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:36.363
But Zing took off just in time.

62
00:03:37.103 --> 00:03:40.026
He flew over the river and landed on the far side.

63
00:03:40.626 --> 00:03:43.569
Then he looked back and hooted triumphantly at the kids.

64
00:03:43.589 --> 00:03:47.272
"Drat!" Zann snapped his fingers to levitate.

65
00:03:48.032 --> 00:03:52.016
While he and Perda floated over the river, he kept talking to the spy fly.

66
00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:54.261
"I'd never heard of Fest before.

67
00:03:54.621 --> 00:03:55.762
It sounds pretty weird.

68
00:03:56.682 --> 00:03:58.423
The people there are shape-shifters.

69
00:03:59.364 --> 00:04:00.644
They can look like anyone."

70
00:04:01.265 --> 00:04:03.806
"Anyone humanoid, that is," Perda said.

71
00:04:03.826 --> 00:04:08.429
"So a Festian can look exactly like Zann or like the queen.

72
00:04:09.429 --> 00:04:12.291
But they can't look nonhuman like a dragon or a tree."

73
00:04:13.171 --> 00:04:14.792
Zann landed on the far bank.

74
00:04:14.812 --> 00:04:20.315
"Anyway, my mom and the other adults think maybe a Festian shifted shape to look like someone who

75
00:04:20.335 --> 00:04:22.176
was allowed to go in with the relics."

76
00:04:23.732 --> 00:04:24.753
"Right," Perda said.

77
00:04:24.773 --> 00:04:28.854
"That way the guard wouldn't stop him or her from going in.

78
00:04:29.755 --> 00:04:33.976
The Festian could have walked right out with the pieces of the mask hidden under his or her

79
00:04:34.036 --> 00:04:37.658
clothes." Zing had flown up into a tree.

80
00:04:38.578 --> 00:04:39.799
He was staring at a bird.

81
00:04:40.719 --> 00:04:43.260
Zann saw his chance and rubbed his hands together.

82
00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.801
"What are you doing?"

83
00:04:45.061 --> 00:04:46.301
Perda asked quietly.

84
00:04:46.321 --> 00:04:47.542
"You'll see."

85
00:04:48.342 --> 00:04:49.383
Zann grinned at her.

86
00:04:50.143 --> 00:04:52.404
She wasn't the only one who could be clever with magic.

87
00:04:53.004 --> 00:04:55.465
He pointed to a spot just above Zing in the tree.

88
00:04:56.546 --> 00:04:59.728
Poof! A net appeared there, hanging in midair.

89
00:05:00.468 --> 00:05:03.990
When Zann brought his hand down, the net fell right over Zing.

90
00:05:04.971 --> 00:05:07.052
The little dragon squealed with dismay.

91
00:05:07.812 --> 00:05:11.114
He shot fire out of his mouth, trying to burn through the net.

92
00:05:11.934 --> 00:05:12.975
But it was too late.

93
00:05:13.715 --> 00:05:16.597
The net tumbled to the ground, and Zann grabbed him.

94
00:05:16.617 --> 00:05:21.820
"Give up, Zing," he said, ignoring the burn from the dragon's angry flames.

95
00:05:22.844 --> 00:05:23.324
"I won.

96
00:05:23.684 --> 00:05:27.746
But don't worry, I told Mima to give you all the dried squiggle fish you can eat."

97
00:05:28.807 --> 00:05:32.208
Zing suddenly went still at the mention of his favorite treat.

98
00:05:33.329 --> 00:05:35.190
Perda laughed at the dragon's reaction.

99
00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:38.311
"Sorry about the interruption, Zella.

100
00:05:39.192 --> 00:05:41.332
We should probably end this and get to the zoo.

101
00:05:42.333 --> 00:05:46.555
Oh! That reminds me, we didn't tell you the main reason we're sending you this message."

102
00:05:47.575 --> 00:05:48.796
"Right," Zann said.

103
00:05:49.804 --> 00:05:54.969
"The queen wants to know more about your cave and that disappearing staff, in case they're connected to

104
00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.391
King Zanta and the mask.

105
00:05:57.372 --> 00:06:00.655
So she's sending a group of people to Stone Wall to check it out.

106
00:06:01.496 --> 00:06:07.342
My parents, my grandfather, and a few others are going, along with He grinned.

107
00:06:07.362 --> 00:06:09.624
"The two of us.

108
00:06:10.806 --> 00:06:12.347
We leave first thing in the morning!"
